url: "https://cloudandsre.com"
abstract: "Turns a Backstage software catalog, OpenTelemetry service-graph edges and incident history into an operational context graph that AI agents query over MCP through bounded, read-only tools (blast radius, ownership, change risk, catalog drift), with Neo4j as an optional system of record and a deterministic evaluation against flat retrieval."
